              "segment": {
                "start_index": 742,
                "end_index": 987,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **360-Degree Division:** While the concept originated in Babylonian mathematics, Hipparchus was the first to systematically introduce the division of a circle into 360 degrees to the Greek world, applying it directly to astronomy and geography"
