              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1753,
                "end_index": 1941,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **The Armillary Sphere and Celestial Globe:** To map the stars, Hipparchus designed and used an **armillary sphere** (a physical model of the celestial sphere made of interlocking rings)"
