              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2111,
                "end_index": 2316,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Systemic and Observational Inventions\n* **The Stellar Magnitude Scale:** To catalog the brightness of stars, Hipparchus invented a classification system that divided stars into six categories of brightness"
