              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3504,
                "end_index": 3674,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Connection to the Antikythera Mechanism\nModern historians have linked Hipparchus to the famous **Antikythera Mechanism**\u2014the world's oldest known geared analog computer"
